  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Government of Tunisia in Enhancing COVID-19 Preparedness and Response at Borders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with IOM Global Strategic Preparedness and Response Plan (SPRP) for COVID-19 and in the framework of IOM&apos;s Health, Border and Mobility Management (HBMM) approach, IOM will work in close cooperation with the Tunisia Ministry of Health and Ministry of Interior to implement concrete and tangible interventions aimed at enhancing the preparedness and response capacity of the Government of Tunisia against disease outbreaks. The project will work directly with authorities at Points of Entry (border officials, health personnel, and local authorities) by taking into consideration their needs to enhance their capacities.</narrative>
  </description>
